NS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feast your eyes on new looks, illustrations and more for nearly every character! Discover never-before-seen character designs and stills, refreshed familiar faces, and newly-drawn weapon and armor items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847150/extras/8419385787bd8e2b8c8f01abe9ec11ac.poster.avif?t=1748503213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847150/extras/8419385787bd8e2b8c8f01abe9ec11ac.webm?t=1748503213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847150/extras/8419385787bd8e2b8c8f01abe9ec11ac.mp4?t=1748503213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now then, time to explore those mysteries!</p>","developers":["AQUASTYLE","ankaa studio"],"dlc":[3068120,2898290,3150380,3296810],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847150/header.jpg?t=1748503213","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Team Shanghai Alice \u00a9Phoenixx Developed by AQUASTYLE \u00d7 ankaa studio","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1847150/700360/ffd17bc704612fc4ce156afd0ad83f756d8fa39d/1751038187/dash_av1.mpd?t=1715747464","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/18